# The emulator's unit cannot start: acquire exits 77 naming the unit. The lease it made stays, with
# no device in it.
break systemd-run
$ a@plain-a devlab acquire --emulator
2> devlab: booting 1 emulator(s), about a minute (quick boot) or three (first boot)
2> devlab: could not start devlab-emu-0: Failed to start transient service unit: Unit devlab-emu-0.service was already loaded or has a fragment file.
? 77
$ a@plain-a devlab status
1> devices: none attached
1> memory <mem> GB free; watcher active
? 0
$ a@plain-a devlab env
1> export DEVLAB_LEASE=1
? 0
